\newlabel{fig:anderson_stiffness}{{3}{5}{\textbf {F5: Anderson Acceleration.} Anderson achieves $< 0.95 \times $ Picard iterations on stiff contractions ($\rho =0.999$), validating theory. No advantage at easy $\rho $ (0.9), as expected}{figure.caption.3}{}}
